{"unit_id":"HeIIoAgain__dsh-notify-email#card-zh","repo":"HeIIoAgain/dsh-notify-email","commit":"15344893076387606c766bda0c4eae138c952f52","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notify-email 是面向 DSH 的邮件通知插件，可在等待用户回答或工具授权时发送提醒，也能按需投递邮件。它向 DSH 注册 send_email 工具，并监听回合结束事件以选择性发送摘要。邮件通过可配置的 SMTP 服务器发送，支持多个收件人和附件；附件支持常见文件类型并有大小与数量上限。适合希望通过邮箱接收任务进展或转发结果的 DSH 用户。需要 SMTP 账号和授权码文件或环境变量。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:258-352","index.js:354-439","index.js:162-229"]}
{"unit_id":"HeIIoAgain__dsh-notify-email#card-en","repo":"HeIIoAgain/dsh-notify-email","commit":"15344893076387606c766bda0c4eae138c952f52","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-notify-email sends alerts while DSH awaits an answer or tool approval, and provides send_email for on-demand messages with attachments. It can also email turn summaries. It uses configurable SMTP delivery and requires an SMTP account plus an authorization code file or environment variable.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:258-352","index.js:354-439","index.js:162-229"]}
